    <string name="now_stop_monitoring">Stop monitoring</string>
    <string name="now_start_blocked">Android didn\'t let monitoring start. Try again with the app open.</string>
    <string name="now_hero_info_title">About the level and time left</string>
    <string name="now_hero_info_body">Level, state and charger come straight from Android and update every 2 seconds while this screen is open.\n\nTime left is the charge still in the battery divided by how fast it has been draining, averaged over roughly the last 45 minutes. Until there is enough live data it leans on your 7-day average. While charging, Android\'s own estimate is used when the phone offers one; otherwise the charge rate up to 80 percent, then the slower curve this charger showed before.\n\nEstimates need monitoring: start it once and it keeps running in the background.</string>

